              "title": "The shared grid marks unavailable surface imagery over the released DART v004 global shape. DRACO and LICIACube observations constrain different regions; the closed mesh also contains modeled terrain. It represents the encounter-era body, not a measured post-impact surface. Lighting uses an arbitrary display phase about the observed pole; no photographic texture or albedo is shown.",
